    "name": "Monster Mart",
    "steam_appid": 3714050,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714050/extras/d0d1be1171bf2ebc0f6526a4095bb829.avif?t=1747813903\" width=800 height=266 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build the monster market of your dreams! Explore the world, catch wild monsters, train them, feed them, and keep them clean. Then evolve, battle, or even sell them! Decorate your store, unlock new shelves and furniture, stock your products, and set your own prices. Your choices shape your shop \u2014 and your profits.<br><br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714050/extras/c015c8884ef23959bb117f0e9d96de0c.avif?t=1747813903\" width=800 height=266 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Store management: buy boxes, stock shelves, and manage prices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full shop decoration and furniture placement.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic pricing: customer satisfaction depends on your strategy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catch, train, feed, clean, and EVOLVE your own monsters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monster battling and selling system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simulation with stats like morale, energy, and hygiene.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Daily cycle, debt system, and profit reports.<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714050/extras/593d268759567c9d6ced7d353a432565.avif?t=1747813903\" width=800 height=266 /></span><br><br>Imagine this: You're running your own cozy store in a colorful little town. You place every shelf, set every price, and decorate every corner just the way you like. But that\u2019s not all \u2014 you also explore the world to catch adorable monsters, care for them, train them, and, if you choose, sell them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game blends imagination, strategy, and heart:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The store is yours \u2014 run it your way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The monsters are yours \u2014 raise them your way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customers, products, debts, decisions... all in your hands.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><br></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714050/extras/d0d1be1171bf2ebc0f6526a4095bb829.avif?t=1747813903\" width=800 height=266 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build the monster market of your dreams! Explore the world, catch wild monsters, train them, feed them, and keep them clean. Then evolve, battle, or even sell them! Decorate your store, unlock new shelves and furniture, stock your products, and set your own prices. Your choices shape your shop \u2014 and your profits.<br><br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714050/extras/c015c8884ef23959bb117f0e9d96de0c.avif?t=1747813903\" width=800 height=266 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Store management: buy boxes, stock shelves, and manage prices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full shop decoration and furniture placement.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic pricing: customer satisfaction depends on your strategy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catch, train, feed, clean, and EVOLVE your own monsters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monster battling and selling system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simulation with stats like morale, energy, and hygiene.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Daily cycle, debt system, and profit reports.<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714050/extras/593d268759567c9d6ced7d353a432565.avif?t=1747813903\" width=800 height=266 /></span><br><br>Imagine this: You're running your own cozy store in a colorful little town. You place every shelf, set every price, and decorate every corner just the way you like. But that\u2019s not all \u2014 you also explore the world to catch adorable monsters, care for them, train them, and, if you choose, sell them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game blends imagination, strategy, and heart:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The store is yours \u2014 run it your way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The monsters are yours \u2014 raise them your way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customers, products, debts, decisions... all in your hands.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><br></p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Welcome to your cozy Monster Mart!Catch adorable monsters, care for their every need, and evolve them into rare companions \u2014 or sell them to eager customers. Decorate your shop, manage prices, and navigate the charming chaos of capitalism in a warm, slow-paced life sim full of personality.",
